    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i dont think there's anything left to \"navigate\" to. it's not like i'm just in a bad phase. the person who had the drive, the talent, the purpose... they're gone. i'm just stuck living in the aftermath of a life that already finished. it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the part of me that already died. does that even make sense? like is there even a point to staying when the main character is already gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
