      "content": "but \"just existing\" feels so pointless. it feels like i'm just watching a movie where the credits already rolled but the screen hasn't gone black yet. it's just... an endless, hollow loop. if the story is already over, and the person that mattered is gone, why does the body have to keep dragging itself through these empty days? it feels more like a burden than a life at this point.",
